<h2 class=3D"date-header"><span>Sunday, December 18, 2011</span></h2>

          <div class=3D"date-posts">
       =20
<div class=3D"post-outer">
<div class=3D"post hentry uncustomized-post-template" itemprop=3D"blogPost"=
 itemscope=3D"itemscope" itemtype=3D"http://schema.org/BlogPosting">
<meta content=3D"1168298421556519669" itemprop=3D"blogId">
<meta content=3D"1156925432346353867" itemprop=3D"postId">
<a name=3D"1156925432346353867"></a>
<h3 class=3D"post-title entry-title" itemprop=3D"name">
<a href=3D"http://fractalfinance.blogspot.com/2011/12/current-research.html=
">Current research</a>
</h3>
<div class=3D"post-header">
<div class=3D"post-header-line-1"></div>
</div>
<div class=3D"post-body entry-content" id=3D"post-body-1156925432346353867"=
 itemprop=3D"description articleBody">
For a follow-up of my discussion with Elie Ayache, about "The Blank Swan" a=
nd its consequences, those interested can look up this forum's <a href=3D"h=
ttp://www.nuclearphynance.com/Show%20Post.aspx?PostIDKey=3D144145">thread</=
a>, from page 22.<br>This is the focus of my current researches.
